stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> STANDBY: App Loaded
    STANDBY --> STARTING: POST /sessions/start
    STARTING --> ROE_PENDING: Container Ready
    ROE_PENDING --> ACTIVE: ROE Acknowledged
    ACTIVE --> ACTIVE: Command/Note/Hint/Alert
    ACTIVE --> ENDING: POST /sessions/end
    ENDING --> COMPLETED: Cleanup Finished
    COMPLETED --> [*]
